# Skills hub (workspace reminder)

- **Variable:** `AGENT_SKILLS_ROOT` — canonical skills inventory and personal Cursor skills under this machine’s `agent-skills` hub.
- **Author skills only at:** `%AGENT_SKILLS_ROOT%\cursor\skills\<name>\SKILL.md` (same files as `%USERPROFILE%\.cursor\skills\...` via junction).
- **Health check:**  
  `powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File "%AGENT_SKILLS_ROOT%\scripts\Verify-AgentSkillsEnv.ps1"`

Global policy is duplicated in `~/.cursor/rules/agent-skills-root.mdc`; this rule keeps the **`mihir`** workspace aligned if global rules are ever disabled.
